<title>USA: U.S. stocks higher at open.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks higher at open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks were higher at the open Tuesday, seeing some followthrough after the Dow industrials closed at a new record high yesterday.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials index was up five at 7,084. The 30-year long bond off 4/32 to yield 6.83 percent.</p>
